# GEPA optimizer output. run_gepa.py writes gepa_optimize/output_<program>_<ts>/,
# holding an optimized program JSON (evolved prompt instructions) plus its
# scores. Two such directories were previously COMMITTED, one of them
# containing tuned instructions for hover's own create_query_hop2 signature --
# a prior optimizer's solution to a live benchmark, sitting in the repo the
# next optimizer reads. Ignore the whole shape so that cannot recur.
gepa_optimize/output_*/
